---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { kagariAssets } from "../assets";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="404 | Yuimi Lab"
  description="这个页面迷路了。"
  honorThemePreference={false}
  redirectThemedNotFound={true}
>
  <section class="not-found">
    <div class="not-found-copy">
      <p class="section-kicker">Lost Page</p>
      <h1>404</h1>
      <p>这张便签好像被风吹走了。回到首页，我们重新翻开下一页。</p>
      <a class="back-link" href="/">← 回到首页</a>
      <a class="back-link" href="/themes/blank/">打开 Blank 主题</a>
    </div>
    <figure class="not-found-visual">
      <img src={kagariAssets.notFound} alt="404 illustration" />
    </figure>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
